  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[“Their only dreams are of full stomachs.”
—Kleon the Iron-Booted]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[« Ils ne rêvent que de ventres pleins. »
—Kléon le Ferré]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[“Sueñan únicamente con estómagos llenos”.
—Kleon, el de las botas de hierro]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[„Sie träumen ausschließlich von prall gefüllten Mägen.“
—Kleon Eisenstiefel]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[“Il loro unico sogno è avere lo stomaco pieno.”
—Cleone dagli Stivali di Ferro]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[「連中が唯一夢見ることは腹いっぱいになることだけだ。」
――鉄靴のクリオン]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA["그들의 꿈은 배부르게 먹는 것뿐이다."
—철장화 클리온]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[«Предел их мечтаний — набитое брюхо».
— Клеон Железноногий]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[“Eles sonham apenas com barrigas cheias.”
— Cleon Bota de Ferro]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[「他们唯一的梦想就是填饱胃袋。」
～铁靴克利恩]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[「他們唯一的夢想就是填飽胃袋。」
～鐵靴克利恩]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
